      "username": "keerthana_2001",
      "name": "Keerthana murugesan",
      "created_at": "2024-11-02T13:19:45.965Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m working with ERPNext version 15, and I’ve noticed that the <strong>Allow Bulk Edit</strong> option doesn’t appear to be available anymore. I would like to add a MultiSelect table field for editing multiple entries at once.</p>\n<p>Could anyone guide me on how to achieve this or if there’s an alternative for bulk editing these fields?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/issue-with-allow-bulk-edit/113087\">Allow Bulk Edit</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/2/92862f077faf85bb60d26f8d2b3ace74f6517033.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kUdcgW5mZ2xuMAp1uLI6dq7BUVZ\" width=\"293\" height=\"320\"></p>",
