      "created_at": "2024-11-03T01:32:50.767Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can’t set the Allow Bulk Edit on core doctype (custom field).</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubissue\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/issues/19779\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/issues/19779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/frappe/frappe</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\">\n  <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Issue\">\n\t  <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 2.3c3.14 0 5.7 2.56 5.7 5.7s-2.56 5.7-5.7 5.7A5.71 5.71 0 0 1 1.3 8c0-3.14 2.56-5.7 5.7-5.7zM7 1C3.14 1 0 4.14 0 8s3.14 7 7 7 7-3.14 7-7-3.14-7-7-7zm1 3H6v5h2V4zm0 6H6v2h2v-2z\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n    <h4>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/issues/19779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Can not set Allow Bulk Edit to Customize Form</a>\n    </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"github-info\">\n      <div class=\"date\">\n        opened <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2023-01-25\" data-time=\"12:50:12\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">12:50PM - 25 Jan 23 UTC</span>\n      </div>\n\n        <div class=\"date\">\n          closed <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2024-07-30\" data-time=\"09:44:25\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">09:44AM - 30 Jul 24 UTC</span>\n        </div>\n\n      <div class=\"user\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/osamaerksosi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n          <img alt=\"osamaerksosi\" src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48605449?v=4\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n          osamaerksosi\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"labels\">\n        <span style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;background-color: #B8B8B8;padding: 2px;border-radius: 4px;color: #fff;margin-left: 3px;\">\n          bug\n        </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-row\">\n    <p class=\"github-body-container\">When set **Allow Bulk Edit** check in a custom field on Customize Form it's not <span class=\"show-more-container\"><a href=\"\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"show-more\">…</a></span><span class=\"excerpt hidden\">taking any effect and it's not saving it in the custom field.\nI think the problem because there is no field named Allow Bulk Edit in **Custom Field doctype**</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
