      "cooked": "<p>Try this</p><aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"113087\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/patel_aasif/48/43898_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/issue-with-allow-bulk-edit/113087/2\">Issue with Allow Bulk Edit</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/erpnext/6\"><span data-category-id=\"6\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #BF1E2E; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category \"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">ERPNext</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Found the solution but it was not, what we can stander way to do this. I Added that property using Property Setter \n <a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/3/d38e06b37da9b5d1ede6768b10c0767995acfc55.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d38e06b37da9b5d1ede6768b10c0767995acfc55\" title=\"image\">[image]</a> \nsystem should allow us to add this property using Customize Form.\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
